{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "when": {
        "source": {
          "kind": "stream",
          "event": "capabilities",
          "path": "connected"
        },
        "op": "eq",
        "value": false
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "title": "Not connected to a machine",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "title": "This module works through a machine you are connected to",
              "lines": [
                "It reaches the rest of your network from there: SSH to find machines and install the agent, then HTTP to everything the agent runs.",
                "Connect to a machine on the same network as the fleet - the machine list is in the sidebar - and this page fills in by itself."
              ],
              "tone": "info"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "source": {
              "kind": "stream",
              "event": "capabilities",
              "path": "problem"
            },
            "op": "exists"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "section",
              "title": "This machine cannot reach the fleet",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "keyValue",
                  "source": {
                    "kind": "stream",
                    "event": "capabilities"
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "key": "sshVersion",
                      "label": "SSH client"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "problem",
                      "label": "Problem"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "What to do",
                  "lines": [
                    "Something the module cannot work without is missing on the machine you are connected to, so nothing has been read and no figure below would be real.",
                    "Module settings lists every tool it looks for. Install the missing ones there, or connect to a machine that already has them."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                },
                {
                  "type": "actions",
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "label": "Check again",
                      "method": "sweepNow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "when": {
                "source": {
                  "kind": "stream",
                  "event": "capabilities",
                  "path": "warning"
                },
                "op": "exists"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "Working, with something worth knowing",
                  "lines": [
                    "The fleet is being read, and one thing about the machine you are connected to makes it slower or less precise than it could be. Module settings names it."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "subnav",
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "overview",
                  "label": "Overview",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What this page is",
                          "lines": [
                            "One row per machine the module has found, with what its agent reports it is running.",
                            "Colour is worst-first: red means something is failing or a machine has no internet, amber means an agent is missing, out of date, or a service is degraded, green means everything a machine was asked to run is running."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Fleet",
                      "columns": 4,
                      "slowTarget": "service-fleet",
                      "slowAt": {
                        "kind": "stream",
                        "event": "sweep",
                        "path": "t"
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Agents ready",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.ready"
                          },
                          "format": "number",
                          "spark": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "series"
                            },
                            "key": "ready"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "No agent",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.noAgent"
                          },
                          "format": "number",
                          "spark": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "series"
                            },
                            "key": "noAgent"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Unreachable",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.unreachable"
                          },
                          "format": "number",
                          "spark": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "series"
                            },
                            "key": "unreachable"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Machines offline",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.hostsOffline"
                          },
                          "format": "number"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Services running",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.instancesRunning"
                          },
                          "format": "number",
                          "spark": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "series"
                            },
                            "key": "running"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Degraded",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.instancesDegraded"
                          },
                          "format": "number"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Failed",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.instancesFailed"
                          },
                          "format": "number",
                          "spark": {
                            "source": {
                              "kind": "stream",
                              "event": "series"
                            },
                            "key": "failed"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "stat",
                          "label": "Machines",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "fleet",
                            "path": "counts.total"
                          },
                          "format": "number"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Sweep",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "keyValue",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "sweep"
                          },
                          "rows": [
                            {
                              "key": "state",
                              "label": "State"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "message",
                              "label": "Last result"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "done",
                              "label": "Addresses done"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "total",
                              "label": "Addresses planned"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "finishedAt",
                              "label": "Finished",
                              "format": "time"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "durationMs",
                              "label": "Took",
                              "format": "duration"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "actions",
                          "actions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Sweep now",
                              "method": "sweepNow"
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Cancel sweep",
                              "method": "sweepCancel"
                            },
                            {
                              "label": "Collect telemetry now",
                              "method": "collectNow"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "wall",
                  "label": "Status wall",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "Reading the wall",
                          "lines": [
                            "One card per machine. The chips are what its agent is running, and a chip is pinned when it is not healthy - so \"Only what is not ok\" leaves just the things worth looking at.",
                            "Click a card to see everything the machine reported, act on one service, or open a shell."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statusCards",
                      "source": {
                        "kind": "stream",
                        "event": "fleet",
                        "path": "hosts"
                      },
                      "rowKey": "id",
                      "titleKey": "ip",
                      "statusKey": "status",
                      "subtitleKey": "summary",
                      "note": {
                        "key": "note",
                        "label": "Detail",
                        "startOpen": false
                      },
                      "items": {
                        "key": "services",
                        "labelKey": "label",
                        "statusKey": "status",
                        "pinnedKey": "pinned",
                        "visibleRows": 2,
                        "pinnedFilterLabel": "Only what is not ok",
                        "emptyText": "nothing deployed"
                      },
                      "columns": {
                        "default": 3,
                        "min": 1,
                        "max": 6
                      },
                      "rowActions": [
                        {
                          "label": "Probe",
                          "method": "hostProbe",
                          "argsFromRow": [
                            "ip"
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "rowDetail": [
                        {
                          "type": "section",
                          "title": "Machine",
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "keyValue",
                              "source": {
                                "kind": "invoke",
                                "method": "hostInspect",
                                "args": [
                                  "$row.ip"
                                ]
                              },
                              "rows": [
                                {
                                  "key": "hostname",
                                  "label": "Hostname"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "agentBadges",
                                  "label": "Agent",
                                  "format": "badges"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "agentVersion",
                                  "label": "Agent version"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "agentMessage",
                                  "label": "Agent says"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "reachBadges",
                                  "label": "SSH",
                                  "format": "badges"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "note",
                                  "label": "Note"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "publicIp",
                                  "label": "Public address"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "latencyMs",
                                  "label": "Latency (ms)"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "pingTarget",
                                  "label": "Last ping target"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "ipSource",
                                  "label": "Address source"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "lastSeen",
                                  "label": "Last reached",
                                  "format": "time"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "firstSeen",
                                  "label": "First seen",
                                  "format": "time"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "section",
                          "title": "What it is running",
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "table",
                              "source": {
                                "kind": "invoke",
                                "method": "hostInstances",
                                "args": [
                                  "$row.ip"
                                ]
                              },
                              "columns": [
                                {
                                  "key": "displayName",
                                  "label": "Service"
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "stateBadges",
                                  "label": "State",
                                  "format": "badges",
                                  "sortable": false
                                },
                                {
                                  "key": "units",
                                  "label": "Units"
                                }
                              ],
                              "rowKey": "key",
                              "rowActions": [
                                {
                                  "label": "Restart",
                                  "method": "instanceAction",
                                  "argsFromRow": [
                                    "key"
                                  ],
                                  "args": [
                                    "restart"
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "label": "Stop",
                                  "method": "instanceAction",
                                  "argsFromRow": [
                                    "key"
                                  ],
                                  "args": [
                                    "stop"
                                  ],
                                  "confirm": "Stop this service? It stops earning until it is started again.",
                                  "kind": "danger"
                                }
                              ],
                              "emptyText": "Nothing is deployed here yet. Use Services → Deploy to give it something."
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "section",
                          "title": "Actions",
                          "blocks": [
                            {
                              "type": "actions",
                              "actions": [
                                {
                                  "label": "Probe now",
                                  "method": "hostProbe",
                                  "argsFromRow": [
                                    "ip"
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "label": "Forget this machine",
                                  "method": "hostForget",
                                  "argsFromRow": [
                                    "ip"
                                  ],
                                  "confirm": "Drop this machine from the roster? It comes back on the next sweep if an address rule still covers it.",
                                  "kind": "danger"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "terminal",
                              "label": "Open a shell on this machine",
                              "commandTemplate": "ssh -p {{port}} {{username}}@{{ip}}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "emptyText": "No machines have answered yet. Add an address range in Module settings, then sweep."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "network",
                  "label": "Public addresses",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "note",
                      "title": "Why this page exists",
                      "lines": [
                        "Most bandwidth-sharing services forbid several devices behind one connection, and will suspend an account that does it.",
                        "Every agent reports the public address it sees itself as. Machines sharing one address are grouped here, and the Shared column counts how many templates two of them are running that are the same."
                      ],
                      "tone": "info"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Public addresses",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "table",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "invoke",
                            "method": "netRows",
                            "intervalKey": "service-fleet"
                          },
                          "columns": [
                            {
                              "key": "publicIp",
                              "label": "Public address"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "ip",
                              "label": "Machine"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "label",
                              "label": "Label"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "onlineBadges",
                              "label": "Internet",
                              "format": "badges",
                              "sortable": false
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "latencyMs",
                              "label": "Latency (ms)",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "source",
                              "label": "Reported by"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "sharesIp",
                              "label": "Machines on it",
                              "align": "right"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "clashBadges",
                              "label": "Shared",
                              "format": "badges",
                              "sortable": false
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "clashes",
                              "label": "Same service as"
                            }
                          ],
                          "rowKey": "ip",
                          "sortDefault": {
                            "key": "publicIp",
                            "dir": "asc"
                          },
                          "groupModes": [
                            {
                              "id": "public",
                              "label": "By public address",
                              "key": "publicIp"
                            }
                          ],
                          "filterKeys": [
                            "ip",
                            "label",
                            "publicIp",
                            "clashes"
                          ],
                          "emptyText": "No agent has reported a public address yet. They measure one every few seconds once installed."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "history",
                  "label": "History",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What is charted",
                          "lines": [
                            "The last few minutes, from the sweeps this app has run. Anything longer lives on Reports, which reads what the agents themselves kept."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Fleet health",
                      "columns": 2,
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "chart",
                          "title": "Agents",
                          "kind": "line",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "history",
                            "stream": "service-fleet",
                            "keys": [
                              "ready",
                              "noAgent",
                              "unreachable"
                            ],
                            "liveEvent": "series"
                          },
                          "series": [
                            {
                              "key": "ready",
                              "label": "Agent ready",
                              "color": "success"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "noAgent",
                              "label": "No agent",
                              "color": "warning"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "unreachable",
                              "label": "Unreachable",
                              "color": "destructive"
                            }
                          ],
                          "window": 3600
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "chart",
                          "title": "Services",
                          "kind": "line",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "history",
                            "stream": "service-fleet",
                            "keys": [
                              "running",
                              "degraded",
                              "failed"
                            ],
                            "liveEvent": "series"
                          },
                          "series": [
                            {
                              "key": "running",
                              "label": "Running",
                              "color": "success"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "degraded",
                              "label": "Degraded",
                              "color": "warning"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "failed",
                              "label": "Failed",
                              "color": "destructive"
                            }
                          ],
                          "window": 3600
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Last six hours",
                      "columns": 2,
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "chart",
                          "title": "Agents",
                          "kind": "line",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "history",
                            "stream": "service-fleet",
                            "keys": [
                              "ready",
                              "noAgent",
                              "unreachable"
                            ],
                            "liveEvent": "series"
                          },
                          "series": [
                            {
                              "key": "ready",
                              "label": "Agent ready",
                              "color": "success"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "noAgent",
                              "label": "No agent",
                              "color": "warning"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "unreachable",
                              "label": "Unreachable",
                              "color": "destructive"
                            }
                          ],
                          "window": 21600
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "chart",
                          "title": "Machines with no internet",
                          "kind": "area",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "history",
                            "stream": "service-fleet",
                            "keys": [
                              "offline"
                            ],
                            "liveEvent": "series"
                          },
                          "series": [
                            {
                              "key": "offline",
                              "label": "Offline",
                              "color": "destructive"
                            }
                          ],
                          "window": 21600
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
